entries[56460] = { ["name"] = "Cobalt Frag Bomb", ["text"] = "2 sec cast\nTools: Arclight Spanner , Gyromatic Micro-Adjustor\nReagents:\nHandful of Cobalt Bolts (2), Volatile Blasting Trigger\nProfession Trainer:\nNorthrend Engineering (1)\nCost:\n10\n\n(3)\nUse: Inflicts ( 29 * 10) to ( 37 * 10) Fire damage and incapacitates targets for 3 sec in a 3 yard radius. Any damage will break the effect.\n\nThe frag bomb has no effect on creatures above level 49. (1 Min Cooldown)\n10\nRequires Northrend Engineering\n(1)" }
